new const photographer_msg_quest[7][] =
{
	{"{"#cWH"}    Greetings {"#cBL"}%s{"#cWH"}\nOur city hall in order to prepare a report, you need a photo with {"#cBL"}\"%s\"{"#cWH"}.\nYou could not make us a couple of photos, we will pay you for this {"#cBL"}1000{"#cWH"}$" },
	{"{"#cBL"}     Hello son! \n{"#cWH"}I have been retired for a long time, but rumors reached me that they were selling weapons to illegal immigrants on a military base. \nCould you go to the military base, and take 2-3 photos around the perimeter of the base. \n    I'm ready to pay you for it {"#cBL"}3.000{"#cWH"}$" },
	{"{"#cWH"}  I was notified here that in Las Venturas there are very bad roads. \nBut this is strange, since we have allocated financing for repairs last month. \n  Could you go there and photograph the condition of the roads. \n  I don't have time at all to do it yourself. \n    I will pay you for that {"#cBL"}2.500{"#cWH"}$" },
	{"{"#cBL"}       Hello my friend!\n   {"#cWH"}I am going to build a new residential complex in San Fiero with my team\n   But in order to get investments, I need to develop a business plan.\nAnd for him I need photos of the wasteland in the city of San Fiero, I will pay you {"#cBL"}2.000{"#cWH"}$ I hope you can handle this task." },
	{"{"#cBL"}      Hello granddaughter.\n  {"#cWH"}Could you take a couple of photos of a lighthouse in the city of Los-Santos.\nOnce upon a time I met my husband there, we really want a beautiful photo of this place.\n     We will pay you for this {"#cBL"}1.500{"#cWH"}$" },
	{"{"#cBL"}      Hi!\n{"#cWH"}I will soon have a divorce with my husband, but I really want to win the court and sue him all the property.\n You could not follow him and find evidence that he is cheating on me.\n     I'm ready to pay you {"#cBL"}2.500{"#cWH"}$" },
	{"{"#cBL"}    Hello my son.\n{"#cWH"} They asked to send photos, but unfortunately I do not know how to photograph.\n  Could you take a couple of photos of my church.\n    I will pay you for that {"#cBL"}2.000{"#cWH"}$" }
};

