   			GangZoneFlashForAll ( gz_info [ i ] [ gz_created ], f_info [ p_info [ playerid ] [ member ] - 1 ] [ f_radar_color ] ) ;

			gz_capture_type = 0 ;

			gz_info [ i ] [ gz_timer ] = SetTimerEx ( "gangzone_timer", 1000, 1, "iiii", i, p_info [ playerid ] [ member ], gz_info [ i ] [ gz_owner ], gz_capture_type ) ;
			break ;
		}
	}
	return 1 ;
}

CMD:newcapt(playerid)
{
    if ( p_info [ playerid ] [ admin ] < 6 )return 1 ;
	new _t_string [ 128 ] ;
	format ( _t_string, sizeof ( _t_string ), "<< %s[%d]: [GHETTO] «·”Ìÿ—… jdeda - 3mlo «·√„— /capturetime 7ata tchofo chkoun ra7 yel3ab. >>", p_info [ playerid ] [ name ], playerid ) ;
	foreach(new i: logged_players)SendClientMessage ( i, 0xCAE1FFFF, _t_string ) ;
	return 1;
}

CMD:captstats(playerid)
{
    if(! gang_player ( playerid ) && ! mafia_player ( playerid )) return 1;
    //if(gz_captured == -1) return SendClientMessage(playerid, col_gray, "There is not a capture right now.");
    new string[1000];
    //format(string, sizeof(string), "{%s}%s\t%d",f_info [ p_info [ playerid ] [ member ] - 1 ] [ f_chat_color ], p_info[playerid][name], CaptureKills[playerid]);
    foreach(new i : logged_players)
    {
        if(IsPlayerConnected(i) && capture_gang_cd [ p_info [ playerid ] [ member ] - 18 ] == capture_gang_cd [ p_info [ i ] [ member ] - 18 ])
        {
            format(string, sizeof(string), "«·«”„\t«·ﬁ ·\n{%s}%s\t%d",f_info [ p_info [ i ] [ member ] - 1 ] [ f_chat_color ], p_info[i][name], CaptureKills[i]);
        }
    }
    new title[80];
    format(title, sizeof(title), "«·”Ìÿ—… «·≈Õ’«∆Ì« ");
    show_dialog(playerid, d_none, DIALOG_STYLE_TABLIST_HEADERS, title, string, "≈€·«ﬁ", "");
    return 1;
}
alias:captstats("captureinfo", "captinfo")

CMD:capturetime ( playerid )
{
	if ( ! gang_player ( playerid ) && ! mafia_player ( playerid )) return 1 ;
	new line_string [ 98 ] ;
	global_string = "{"#cGR"}Êﬁ  «·”Ìÿ—… ⁄·Ï «·„‰ÿﬁ… „‰ 12:00 ≈·Ï 23:00\n\n" ;
	for ( new j = 0 ; j < 11 ; j ++ )
	{
		format ( line_string, sizeof ( line_string ), "{%s}ﬁ»· «·”Ìÿ—… %s:{"#cWH"} %s\n",
		f_info [ j + 17 ] [ f_chat_color ], f_info [ j + 17 ] [ f_name ], convert_time ( capture_gang_cd [ j ] ) ) ;
		strcat ( global_string, line_string ) ;

	}
	show_dialog ( playerid, d_none, DIALOG_STYLE_MSGBOX, "{"#cBL"}„⁄·Ê„« ", global_string, "≈€·«ﬁ", "" ) ;
	return 1 ;
}

callback: az_zone_timer ( az_tid, az_attacker_team, az_owner_team, capture_type )
{
	foreach(new pl_id: logged_players)
	{
		if ( ( ! terrorist_player ( pl_id ) && ! army_player ( pl_id ) ) && GetPVarInt ( pl_id, "az_td_status" ) == 1 )
		{
			for ( new j = 0 ; j < 18 ; j ++ )
			{
				TextDrawHideForPlayer ( pl_id, az_capture_td [ j ] ) ;

			}
			DeletePVar ( pl_id, "az_td_status" ) ;
			//for ( new j = 0 ; j < 8 ; j ++ ) SendDeathMessageToPlayer ( pl_id, 1001, 1001, 200 ) ;
		}
		else if ( ( terrorist_player ( pl_id ) || army_player ( pl_id ) ) && GetPVarInt ( pl_id, "az_td_status" ) == 0 )
		{
			for ( new j = 0 ; j < 18 ; j ++ )
			{
				TextDrawShowForPlayer ( pl_id, az_capture_td [ j ] ) ;
			}
			GangZoneFlashForPlayer ( pl_id, az_info [ az_tid ] [ az_created ], f_info [ az_attacker_team - 1 ] [ f_radar_color ] ) ;
			SetPVarInt ( pl_id, "az_td_status", 1 ) ;
		}
	}
	if ( az_info [ az_tid ] [ az_time ] >= 1)
	{
		az_info [ az_tid ] [ az_time ] --;

		new td_string [ 24 ] ;
		format ( td_string, sizeof ( td_string ), "«·”Ìÿ—…_«·Êﬁ :_%s", convert_time ( az_info [ az_tid ] [ az_time ] ) ) ;
		TextDrawSetString ( az_capture_td [ 5 ], td_string ) ;
		if ( capture_type == 1 )
		{
			az_owner_points = 0,
				az_attacker_points	= 0 ;

			foreach(new i: logged_players)
			{
				if ( p_info [ i ] [ member ] != az_info [ az_tid ] [ az_owner ] && p_info [ i ] [ member ] != az_info [ az_tid ] [ az_attacker ] )continue ;
				if ( ! IsPlayerInAzZone ( i, az_captured ) )continue ;
				if ( p_info [ i ] [ member ] == az_info [ az_tid ] [ az_owner ] ) az_owner_points ++ ;
				else if ( p_info [ i ] [ member ] == az_info [ az_tid ] [ az_attacker ] ) az_attacker_points ++ ;
			}
			format ( td_string, 8, "%d", az_attacker_points ) ;
			TextDrawSetString ( az_capture_td [ 17 ], td_string ) ;

			format ( td_string, 8, "%d", az_owner_points ) ;
			TextDrawSetString ( az_capture_td [ 16 ], td_string ) ;
			return 1 ;
		}
	}
	else if ( az_info [ az_tid ] [ az_time ] < 1 )
	{
		if ( capture_type == 0 )
		{
			if ( az_owner_points >= az_attacker_points ) // home ›Ê“
			{
				new _string [ 92 ] ;
				format ( _string, sizeof ( _string ), "%s œ«›⁄  ⁄‰ „‰ÿﬁ Â«.",
				f_info [ az_info [ az_tid ] [ az_owner ] - 1 ] [ f_name ] ) ;
				SendAzMessage ( col_blue, _string ) ;

				mysql_tquery ( sql_connection, "SELECT `f_org`, `f_to_org` FROM `f_wars`", "Wars_Info", "iiiii", az_info [ az_tid ] [ az_attacker ], az_info [ az_tid ] [ az_owner ], az_attacker_points, az_owner_points, 0 ) ;
			}
			else if ( az_owner_points < az_attacker_points ) // attack ›Ê“
			{
				new _string [ 128 ] ;
				format ( _string, sizeof ( _string ), "%s ”Ìÿ—  ⁄·Ï „‰ÿﬁ… „‰ %s.",
				f_info [ az_info [ az_tid ] [ az_attacker ] - 1 ] [ f_name ],
				f_info [ az_info [ az_tid ] [ az_owner ] - 1 ] [ f_name ] ) ;
				SendAzMessage ( col_blue, _string ) ;

				mysql_tquery ( sql_connection, "SELECT `f_org`, `f_to_org` FROM `f_wars`", "Wars_Info", "iiiii", az_info [ az_tid ] [ az_attacker ], az_info [ az_tid ] [ az_owner ], az_attacker_points, az_owner_points, 1 ) ;

				az_info [ az_tid ] [ az_owner ] = az_info [ az_tid ] [ az_attacker ] ;
			}

			foreach(new i: logged_players)
			{
				if ( GetPVarInt ( i, "az_td_status" ) == 1 )
				{
					for ( new j = 0 ; j < 18 ; j ++ )
					{
						TextDrawHideForPlayer ( i, az_capture_td [ j ] ) ;
					}
					DeletePVar ( i, "az_td_status" ) ;
					//for ( new j = 0 ; j < 8 ; j ++ ) SendDeathMessageToPlayer ( i, 1001, 1001, 200 ) ;

					new query_string [ 98 ];
					format ( query_string,sizeof(query_string),"UPDATE `users` SET `u_captures` = `u_captures`+1 WHERE `u_member` = '%d' LIMIT 1", az_info [ az_tid ] [ az_owner ] ) ;
					mysql_tquery ( sql_connection, query_string, "", "" ) ;
				}
			}

            mysql_tquery ( sql_connection, "SELECT `u_name`, `u_member`, `u_capture_top` FROM `users` ORDER BY `users`.`u_capture_top` DESC LIMIT 3", "capture_top", "i", 0 ) ;

			KillTimer ( az_info [ az_tid ] [ az_timer ] ) ;

			az_captured = - 1,
				az_owner_points = - 1,
					az_attacker_points	= - 1 ;

			az_info [ az_tid ] [ az_time ] = 0 ;
			az_info [ az_tid ] [ az_attacker ] = 0 ;


			GangZoneStopFlashForAll( az_info [ az_tid ] [ az_created ] ) ;
			GangZoneHideForAll ( az_info [ az_tid ] [ az_created ] ) ;
			GangZoneShowForAll( az_info [ az_tid ] [ az_created ], GetGangZoneColor ( az_info [ az_tid ] [ az_owner ] ) ) ;
			SaveAzZone ( az_tid ) ;
		}
		else
		{
			az_owner_points = 0,
				az_attacker_points	= 0 ;

			foreach(new i: logged_players)
			{
				if ( p_info [ i ] [ member ] != az_info [ az_tid ] [ az_owner ] && p_info [ i ] [ member ] != az_info [ az_tid ] [ az_attacker ] )continue ;
				if ( p_info [ i ] [ member ] == az_info [ az_tid ] [ az_owner ] ) az_owner_points ++ ;
				else if ( p_info [ i ] [ member ] == az_info [ az_tid ] [ az_attacker ] ) az_attacker_points ++ ;

				new query_string [ 98 ];
				format ( query_string,sizeof(query_string),"UPDATE `users` SET `u_captures` = `u_captures`+1 WHERE `u_id` = '%d' LIMIT 1", p_info [ i ] [ id ] ) ;
				mysql_tquery ( sql_connection, query_string, "", "" ) ;


				if ( GetPVarInt ( i, "az_td_status" ) == 1 )
				{
					for ( new j = 0 ; j < 18 ; j ++ )
					{
						TextDrawHideForPlayer ( i, az_capture_td [ j ] ) ;
					}
					DeletePVar ( i, "az_td_status" ) ;
					//for ( new j = 0 ; j < 8 ; j ++ ) SendDeathMessageToPlayer ( i, 1001, 1001, 200 ) ;
				}
			}
			if ( az_owner_points >= az_attacker_points ) // home ›Ê“
			{
				new _string [ 92 ] ;
				format ( _string, sizeof ( _string ), "%s œ«›⁄  ⁄‰ „‰ÿﬁ Â«.",
				f_info [ az_info [ az_tid ] [ az_owner ] - 1 ] [ f_name ] ) ;
				SendAzMessage ( col_blue, _string ) ;

				mysql_tquery ( sql_connection, "SELECT `f_org`, `f_to_org` FROM `f_wars`", "Wars_Info", "iiiii", az_info [ az_tid ] [ az_attacker ], az_info [ az_tid ] [ az_owner ], az_attacker_points, az_owner_points, 0 ) ;
			}
			else if ( az_owner_points < az_attacker_points ) // attack ›Ê“
			{
				new _string [ 128 ] ;
				format ( _string, sizeof ( _string ), "%s ”Ìÿ—  ⁄·Ï „‰ÿﬁ… „‰ %s.",
				f_info [ az_info [ az_tid ] [ az_attacker ] - 1 ] [ f_name ],
				f_info [ az_info [ az_tid ] [ az_owner ] - 1 ] [ f_name ] ) ;
				SendAzMessage ( col_blue, _string ) ;

				mysql_tquery ( sql_connection, "SELECT `f_org`, `f_to_org` FROM `f_wars`", "Wars_Info", "iiiii", az_info [ az_tid ] [ az_attacker ], az_info [ az_tid ] [ az_owner ], az_attacker_points, az_owner_points, 1 ) ;

				az_info [ az_tid ] [ az_owner ] = az_info [ az_tid ] [ az_attacker ] ;
			}

			mysql_tquery ( sql_connection, "SELECT `u_name`, `u_member`, `u_capture_top` FROM `users` ORDER BY `users`.`u_capture_top` DESC LIMIT 3", "capture_top", "i", 0 ) ;

			KillTimer ( az_info [ az_tid ] [ az_timer ] ) ;

			az_captured = - 1,
				az_owner_points = - 1,
					az_attacker_points	= - 1 ;

			az_info [ az_tid ] [ az_time ] = 0 ;
			az_info [ az_tid ] [ az_attacker ] = 0 ;


			GangZoneStopFlashForAll( az_info [ az_tid ] [ az_created ] ) ;
			GangZoneHideForAll ( az_info [ az_tid ] [ az_created ] ) ;
			GangZoneShowForAll( az_info [ az_tid ] [ az_created ], GetGangZoneColor ( az_info [ az_tid ] [ az_owner ] ) ) ;
			SaveAzZone ( az_tid ) ;
		}
	}
	return 1 ;
}

callback: gangzone_timer ( gz_tid, gz_attacker_team, gz_owner_team, capture_type )
{
	foreach(new pl_id: logged_players)
	{
		if ( ( ! gang_player ( pl_id ) && ! mafia_player ( pl_id ) ) && GetPVarInt ( pl_id, "gz_td_status" ) == 1 )
		{
			for ( new j = 0 ; j < 18 ; j ++ )
			{
				TextDrawHideForPlayer ( pl_id, capture_td [ j ] ) ;

			}
			DeletePVar ( pl_id, "gz_td_status" ) ;
			//for ( new j = 0 ; j < 8 ; j ++ ) SendDeathMessageToPlayer ( pl_id, 1001, 1001, 200 ) ;
		}
		else if ( ( gang_player ( pl_id ) || mafia_player ( pl_id ) ) && GetPVarInt ( pl_id, "gz_td_status" ) == 0 )
		{
			for ( new j = 0 ; j < 18 ; j ++ )
			{
				TextDrawShowForPlayer ( pl_id, capture_td [ j ] ) ;
			}
			GangZoneFlashForPlayer ( pl_id, gz_info [ gz_tid ] [ gz_created ], f_info [ gz_attacker_team - 1 ] [ f_radar_color ] ) ;
			SetPVarInt ( pl_id, "gz_td_status", 1 ) ;
		}
	}
	if ( gz_info [ gz_tid ] [ gz_time ] >= 1)
	{
		gz_info [ gz_tid ] [ gz_time ] --;

		new td_string [ 24 ] ;
		format ( td_string, sizeof ( td_string ), "«·”Ìÿ—…_«·Êﬁ :_%s", convert_time ( gz_info [ gz_tid ] [ gz_time ] ) ) ;
		TextDrawSetString ( capture_td [ 5 ], td_string ) ;
		if ( capture_type == 1 )
		{
			owner_points = 0,
				attacker_points	= 0 ;

			foreach(new i: logged_players)
			{
				if ( p_info [ i ] [ member ] != gz_info [ gz_tid ] [ gz_owner ] && p_info [ i ] [ member ] != gz_info [ gz_tid ] [ gz_attacker ] )continue ;
				if ( ! IsPlayerInGangZone ( i, gz_captured ) )continue ;
				if ( p_info [ i ] [ member ] == gz_info [ gz_tid ] [ gz_owner ] ) owner_points ++ ;
				else if ( p_info [ i ] [ member ] == gz_info [ gz_tid ] [ gz_attacker ] ) attacker_points ++ ;
			}
			format ( td_string, 8, "%d", attacker_points ) ;
			TextDrawSetString ( capture_td [ 17 ], td_string ) ;

			format ( td_string, 8, "%d", owner_points ) ;
			TextDrawSetString ( capture_td [ 16 ], td_string ) ;
			return 1 ;
		}
	}
	else if ( gz_info [ gz_tid ] [ gz_time ] < 1 )
	{
		if ( capture_type == 0 )
		{
			if ( owner_points >= attacker_points ) // home ›Ê“
			{
				new _string [ 92 ] ;
				format ( _string, sizeof ( _string ), "%s œ«›⁄  ⁄‰ „‰ÿﬁ Â«.",
				f_info [ gz_info [ gz_tid ] [ gz_owner ] - 1 ] [ f_name ] ) ;
				SendGangMessage ( col_blue, _string ) ;

				mysql_tquery ( sql_connection, "SELECT `f_org`, `f_to_org` FROM `f_wars`", "Wars_Info", "iiiii", gz_info [ gz_tid ] [ gz_attacker ], gz_info [ gz_tid ] [ gz_owner ], attacker_points, owner_points, 0 ) ;
			}
			else if ( owner_points < attacker_points ) // attack ›Ê“
			{
				new _string [ 128 ] ;
				format ( _string, sizeof ( _string ), "%s ”Ìÿ—  ⁄·Ï „‰ÿﬁ… „‰ %s.",
				f_info [ gz_info [ gz_tid ] [ gz_attacker ] - 1 ] [ f_name ],
				f_info [ gz_info [ gz_tid ] [ gz_owner ] - 1 ] [ f_name ] ) ;
				SendGangMessage ( col_blue, _string ) ;

				mysql_tquery ( sql_connection, "SELECT `f_org`, `f_to_org` FROM `f_wars`", "Wars_Info", "iiiii", gz_info [ gz_tid ] [ gz_attacker ], gz_info [ gz_tid ] [ gz_owner ], attacker_points, owner_points, 1 ) ;

				gz_info [ gz_tid ] [ gz_owner ] = gz_info [ gz_tid ] [ gz_attacker ] ;
			}

			foreach(new i: logged_players)
			{
				if ( GetPVarInt ( i, "gz_td_status" ) == 1 )
				{
					for ( new j = 0 ; j < 18 ; j ++ )
					{
						TextDrawHideForPlayer ( i, capture_td [ j ] ) ;
					}
					DeletePVar ( i, "gz_td_status" ) ;
					//for ( new j = 0 ; j < 8 ; j ++ ) SendDeathMessageToPlayer ( i, 1001, 1001, 200 ) ;

					new query_string [ 98 ];
					format ( query_string,sizeof(query_string),"UPDATE `users` SET `u_captures` = `u_captures`+1 WHERE `u_member` = '%d' LIMIT 1", gz_info [ gz_tid ] [ gz_owner ] ) ;
					mysql_tquery ( sql_connection, query_string, "", "" ) ;
				}
			}

            mysql_tquery ( sql_connection, "SELECT `u_name`, `u_member`, `u_capture_top` FROM `users` ORDER BY `users`.`u_capture_top` DESC LIMIT 3", "capture_top", "i", 0 ) ;

			KillTimer ( gz_info [ gz_tid ] [ gz_timer ] ) ;

			gz_captured = - 1,
				owner_points = - 1,
					attacker_points	= - 1 ;

			gz_info [ gz_tid ] [ gz_time ] = 0 ;
			gz_info [ gz_tid ] [ gz_attacker ] = 0 ;


			GangZoneStopFlashForAll( gz_info [ gz_tid ] [ gz_created ] ) ;
			GangZoneHideForAll ( gz_info [ gz_tid ] [ gz_created ] ) ;
			GangZoneShowForAll( gz_info [ gz_tid ] [ gz_created ], GetGangZoneColor ( gz_info [ gz_tid ] [ gz_owner ] ) ) ;
			SaveGangZone ( gz_tid ) ;
		}
		else
		{
			owner_points = 0,
				attacker_points	= 0 ;

			foreach(new i: logged_players)
			{
				if ( p_info [ i ] [ member ] != gz_info [ gz_tid ] [ gz_owner ] && p_info [ i ] [ member ] != gz_info [ gz_tid ] [ gz_attacker ] )continue ;
				if ( p_info [ i ] [ member ] == gz_info [ gz_tid ] [ gz_owner ] ) owner_points ++ ;
				else if ( p_info [ i ] [ member ] == gz_info [ gz_tid ] [ gz_attacker ] ) attacker_points ++ ;

				new query_string [ 98 ];
				format ( query_string,sizeof(query_string),"UPDATE `users` SET `u_captures` = `u_captures`+1 WHERE `u_id` = '%d' LIMIT 1", p_info [ i ] [ id ] ) ;
				mysql_tquery ( sql_connection, query_string, "", "" ) ;


				if ( GetPVarInt ( i, "gz_td_status" ) == 1 )
				{
					for ( new j = 0 ; j < 18 ; j ++ )
					{
						TextDrawHideForPlayer ( i, capture_td [ j ] ) ;
					}
					DeletePVar ( i, "gz_td_status" ) ;
					//for ( new j = 0 ; j < 8 ; j ++ ) SendDeathMessageToPlayer ( i, 1001, 1001, 200 ) ;
				}
			}
			if ( owner_points >= attacker_points ) // home ›Ê“
			{
				new _string [ 92 ] ;
				format ( _string, sizeof ( _string ), "%s œ«›⁄  ⁄‰ „‰ÿﬁ Â«.",
				f_info [ gz_info [ gz_tid ] [ gz_owner ] - 1 ] [ f_name ] ) ;
				SendGangMessage ( col_blue, _string ) ;

				mysql_tquery ( sql_connection, "SELECT `f_org`, `f_to_org` FROM `f_wars`", "Wars_Info", "iiiii", gz_info [ gz_tid ] [ gz_attacker ], gz_info [ gz_tid ] [ gz_owner ], attacker_points, owner_points, 0 ) ;
			}
			else if ( owner_points < attacker_points ) // attack ›Ê“
			{
				new _string [ 128 ] ;
				format ( _string, sizeof ( _string ), "%s ”Ìÿ—  ⁄·Ï „‰ÿﬁ… „‰ %s.",
				f_info [ gz_info [ gz_tid ] [ gz_attacker ] - 1 ] [ f_name ],
				f_info [ gz_info [ gz_tid ] [ gz_owner ] - 1 ] [ f_name ] ) ;
				SendGangMessage ( col_blue, _string ) ;

				mysql_tquery ( sql_connection, "SELECT `f_org`, `f_to_org` FROM `f_wars`", "Wars_Info", "iiiii", gz_info [ gz_tid ] [ gz_attacker ], gz_info [ gz_tid ] [ gz_owner ], attacker_points, owner_points, 1 ) ;

				gz_info [ gz_tid ] [ gz_owner ] = gz_info [ gz_tid ] [ gz_attacker ] ;
			}

			mysql_tquery ( sql_connection, "SELECT `u_name`, `u_member`, `u_capture_top` FROM `users` ORDER BY `users`.`u_capture_top` DESC LIMIT 3", "capture_top", "i", 0 ) ;

			KillTimer ( gz_info [ gz_tid ] [ gz_timer ] ) ;

			gz_captured = - 1,
				owner_points = - 1,
					attacker_points	= - 1 ;

			gz_info [ gz_tid ] [ gz_time ] = 0 ;
			gz_info [ gz_tid ] [ gz_attacker ] = 0 ;


			GangZoneStopFlashForAll( gz_info [ gz_tid ] [ gz_created ] ) ;
			GangZoneHideForAll ( gz_info [ gz_tid ] [ gz_created ] ) ;
			GangZoneShowForAll( gz_info [ gz_tid ] [ gz_created ], GetGangZoneColor ( gz_info [ gz_tid ] [ gz_owner ] ) ) ;
			SaveGangZone ( gz_tid ) ;
		}
	}
	return 1 ;
}

callback: capture_top ( type )
{
	new _string [ 256 ] ;

    new rows, fields;
    cache_get_data(rows, fields);

    if ( type == 0 ) SendGangMessage ( col_blue, "Capture statistics (TOP 3):\n" ) ;
    else SendMafiaMessage ( col_blue, "Bizwar statistics (TOP 3):\n" ) ;

	for ( new i; i < rows; i ++ )
	{
        new name_player [ 32 ], member_player, capture_player ;
        cache_get_field_content ( i, "u_name", name_player, sql_connection, MAX_PLAYER_NAME ) ;
        member_player = cache_get_field_content_int ( i, "u_member", sql_connection ) ;
        capture_player = cache_get_field_content_int ( i, "u_capture_top", sql_connection ) ;

        if ( capture_player > 0 )
        {
        	format ( _string, 256, "%d. %s [%s] - «·”Ìÿ—… «·ﬁ ·: %d.", i + 1, name_player, f_info [ member_player - 1 ] [ f_name ], CaptureKills[i] ) ;
			if ( type == 0 ) SendGangMessage ( col_white, _string ) ;
			else SendMafiaMessage ( col_white, _string ) ;
		}
		else
		{
		    if ( type == 0 ) SendGangMessage ( col_gray, "* Empty..." ) ;
		    else SendMafiaMessage ( col_gray, "* Empty..." ) ;
		}
	}
	foreach(new i: logged_players)
    {
        CaptureKills[i] = 0;
    }
	mysql_tquery ( sql_connection, "UPDATE `users` SET `u_capture_top` = '0' WHERE `u_capture_top` > '0' LIMIT 1000", "", "" ) ;
	return 1;
}

CMD:warsinfo ( playerid )
{
    if ( ! gang_player ( playerid ) && ! mafia_player ( playerid ) ) return 1 ;
	mysql_tquery ( sql_connection, "SELECT * FROM `f_wars`", "WarsInfo", "i", playerid );
	return 1 ;
}

callback: WarsInfo ( playerid )
{
    new rows, fields;
    cache_get_data(rows, fields);

    SendClientMessage ( playerid, col_blue, "≈Õ’«∆Ì«  «·„Õ«—»Ì‰ «·„«‘Ì‰:\n" ) ;

    if ( ! rows ) return SendClientMessage ( playerid, col_gray, "{"#cRD"}* {"#cGR"}ÌÊÃœ ·« Õ—Ê» «·ÕÌ‰." ) ;
    for ( new i; i < rows; i ++ )
	{
     	new _string [ 144 ] ;
	    new fr_org, fr_to_org, fr_kill, fr_to_kill, fr_capture, fr_to_capture ;
	    fr_org = cache_get_field_content_int ( i, "f_org", sql_connection ) ;
	    fr_to_org = cache_get_field_content_int ( i, "f_to_org", sql_connection ) ;
	    fr_kill = cache_get_field_content_int ( i, "f_kill", sql_connection ) ;
	    fr_to_kill = cache_get_field_content_int ( i, "f_to_kill", sql_connection ) ;
	    fr_capture = cache_get_field_content_int ( i, "f_capture", sql_connection ) ;
	    fr_to_capture = cache_get_field_content_int ( i, "f_to_capture", sql_connection ) ;

	    if ( ( fr_org >= 18 && fr_org <= 28 ) && ( fr_to_org >= 29 && fr_to_org <= 31 ) || ( fr_org >= 39 && fr_org <= 31 ) && ( fr_to_org >= 18 && fr_to_org <= 28 ) ) continue ;

	    format ( _string, sizeof ( _string ), "%d. {%s}%s{"#cWH"} - {%s}%s{"#cWH"}: Ã—«∆„ ﬁ ·: %d - %d, ÕÃÊ“« : %d - %d.", i + 1,
		f_info [ fr_org - 1 ] [ f_chat_color ], f_info [ fr_org - 1 ] [ f_name ], f_info [ fr_to_org - 1 ] [ f_chat_color ], f_info [ fr_to_org - 1 ] [ f_name ], fr_kill, fr_to_kill, fr_capture, fr_to_capture ) ;
	    SendClientMessage ( playerid, col_white, _string ) ;
	}
	return 1;
}

callback: Wars_Info ( attacker, owner, attack_points, own_points, status )
{
    new rows, fields;
    cache_get_data(rows, fields);

    for ( new i; i < rows; i ++ )
	{
	    new _string [ 200 ] ;
	    new fr_org, fr_to_org ;
	    fr_org = cache_get_field_content_int ( i, "f_org", sql_connection ) ;
	    fr_to_org = cache_get_field_content_int ( i, "f_to_org", sql_connection ) ;

		if ( attacker == fr_org && owner == fr_to_org )
		{
		    if ( status == 1 )
		    {
		    	format ( _string,sizeof(_string),"UPDATE `f_wars` SET `f_capture` = `f_capture`+1 WHERE `f_org` = '%d' AND `f_to_org` = '%d' LIMIT 1", attacker, owner ) ;
				mysql_tquery ( sql_connection, _string, "", "" ) ;
			}

			format ( _string,sizeof(_string),"UPDATE `f_wars` SET `f_kill` = `f_kill`+'%d' WHERE `f_org` = '%d' AND `f_to_org` = '%d' LIMIT 1", attack_points, attacker, owner ) ;
			mysql_tquery ( sql_connection, _string, "", "" ) ;

			format ( _string,sizeof(_string),"UPDATE `f_wars` SET `f_to_kill` = `f_to_kill`+'%d' WHERE `f_org` = '%d' AND `f_to_org` = '%d' LIMIT 1", own_points, attacker, owner ) ;
			mysql_tquery ( sql_connection, _string, "", "" ) ;
		}
		else if ( attacker == fr_to_org && owner == fr_org )
		{
		    if ( status == 1 )
		    {
				format ( _string,sizeof(_string),"UPDATE `f_wars` SET `f_to_capture` = `f_to_capture`+1 WHERE `f_org` = '%d' AND `f_to_org` = '%d' LIMIT 1", owner, attacker ) ;
				mysql_tquery ( sql_connection, _string, "", "" ) ;
			}

			format ( _string,sizeof(_string),"UPDATE `f_wars` SET `f_kill` = `f_kill`+'%d' WHERE `f_org` = '%d' AND `f_to_org` = '%d' LIMIT 1", own_points, owner, attacker ) ;
			mysql_tquery ( sql_connection, _string, "", "" ) ;

			format ( _string,sizeof(_string),"UPDATE `f_wars` SET `f_to_kill` = `f_to_kill`+'%d' WHERE `f_org` = '%d' AND `f_to_org` = '%d' LIMIT 1", attack_points, owner, attacker ) ;
			mysql_tquery ( sql_connection, _string, "", "" ) ;
		}
	}
	return 1 ;
}

